    <div class="prose"><p>People with a phone reported more negative affect (b = −.105, t(1436) = −2.009, p = .045, d = −.106). With gender and age in the model it held (b = −.118, p = .027, d = −.119). Men reported more negative affect than women (b = −.185, p = .002, d = −.171). Age did not matter (p = .461). The interaction with gender was not reliable (b = −.159, p = .169, d = −.074).</p></div>

